oes: every gh__setup and GitHub-submit allocation is a single[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]atomic claim whose result is checked and whose ledger record names [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its caller, a pinned n=<num> target that a live agent holds fails [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with that agent named instead of being taken, and no gh workflow [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]step stashes, pulls, or checks out inside a checkout another live [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]agent occupies.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gh_plugin_workspace_exclusivity.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/gh_plugin_workspace_exclusivity.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]202608/workspace_exclusivity.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-q0.5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-q0/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase-q0.5.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Atomic, checked workspace acquisition in the sase-github [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]plugin[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]gh_atomic[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gh_atomic: replace the check-then-claim allocation in gh__setup and in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the GitHub submit path with a single atomic claim, check every claim [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]result, make a pinned n=<num> target a single-shot claim that names the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]occupant on failure, release the slot when materialization fails, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]give every claim and release a caller tag.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refuse gh workflow steps that would prepare an occupied [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]checkout[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]gh_guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gh_atomic[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gh_guard: write the per-checkout occupant record when gh__setup takes a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workspace, clear it on release, and require the occupancy decision [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before gh__prepare stashes, gh__checkout checks out, or the GitHub [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]submit path checks out, so a conflicting occupant fails the run instead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of losing another agent's work.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-q0.5","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-q0.5.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a9d93b2716937a5179ecf2f94abf3dc5","started_at":"2026-08-18T21:41:14.284625+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3aa14c48b169c74b3d7230fb8a2ed739770a333c6d318db4708155a7e1716ffe","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-q0.land--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":2085},"commits":{"digest":"8461b5e25ed9b7b30cddf237bf18146db72acac2511a20d6dd9ade2e77dc09d5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-q0.land--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"ead80604a33bf4a424e59cb5a99ccec466d98dc753476140e4eae6d91007227d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-q0.land--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":706},"state":{"digest":"fb5b30e12db1728ee91a8a68ad5a4468b6ea1bf08fc359bf8e0875ec533ac72a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-q0.land--mon/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-q0.land--mon","local_name":"sase-q0.land--mon","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sa